# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Emacs temporary / backup files
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1. Simple backup files: foo.clj~
*~

# 2. Auto‑save files: #foo.clj#
#*#

# 3. Lock files: .#foo.clj
.#*

# 4. Auto‑save list directory (if Emacs stores it inside the repo)
auto-save-list/

# 5. Optional: a dedicated backup directory you might configure
# *.bak/          # <-- uncomment if you use `backup-directory-alist` with *.bak

